<title>UK: Wace's US chief executive resigns.</title>
<headline>Wace's US chief executive resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British imaging and printing firm Wace Group Plc said on Wednesday Robert Brudzinski, president and chief executive of Wace USA and a main board director, had resigned.</p>
<p>Until Wace finds a replacement Derek Ashley, European managing director, will take responsibility for Wace USA, and will be based in Chicago.</p>
<p>Group chief executive Trevor Grice will take over Derek Ashley's responsibilities for the European operations. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
